  "shortName": "Tap Log",
  "version": "0.01",
  "description": "Log that something happened, with a severity 1-5, by tapping the watch. A double tap plus a single tap arms it; the taps after that are the severity. Uses the accelerometer's own tap detector, so it costs almost no power.",
